OL,3,GNEWSARoad to remain closed after
OL,4,Alandslip
OL,5,
OL,6,FGround investigations were expected to
OL,7,Ftake place at the site next week in
OL,8,Forder for engineers to finalise plans
OL,9,Ffor repair, and it was not yet known
OL,10,Fwhen the road would be fit to reopen,
OL,11,Fit added.
